      "responsibilities": "<ul><li>Develop,&nbsp;maintain,&nbsp;and&nbsp;enhance&nbsp;full-stack&nbsp;web&nbsp;applications&nbsp;to&nbsp;support&nbsp;business&nbsp;operations&nbsp;and&nbsp;digital&nbsp;initiatives.</li><li>Collaborate&nbsp;with&nbsp;users&nbsp;and&nbsp;cross-functional&nbsp;teams&nbsp;to&nbsp;translate&nbsp;business&nbsp;requirements&nbsp;into&nbsp;effective&nbsp;technical&nbsp;solutions.</li><li>Build&nbsp;and&nbsp;integrate&nbsp;frontend,&nbsp;backend,&nbsp;databases,&nbsp;and&nbsp;APIs&nbsp;to&nbsp;deliver&nbsp;scalable,&nbsp;secure,&nbsp;and&nbsp;high-performing&nbsp;applications.</li><li>Perform&nbsp;application&nbsp;testing,&nbsp;troubleshooting,&nbsp;deployment,&nbsp;and&nbsp;continuous&nbsp;system&nbsp;optimization&nbsp;to&nbsp;ensure&nbsp;reliability&nbsp;and&nbsp;performance.</li><li>Prepare&nbsp;and&nbsp;maintain&nbsp;technical&nbsp;documentation&nbsp;while&nbsp;contributing&nbsp;to&nbsp;development&nbsp;standards&nbsp;and&nbsp;best&nbsp;practices.</li><li>Stay&nbsp;updated&nbsp;with&nbsp;emerging&nbsp;technologies&nbsp;and&nbsp;continuously&nbsp;improve&nbsp;development&nbsp;efficiency&nbsp;and&nbsp;solution&nbsp;quality.</li></ul>",
      "requirements": "<ul><li>Bachelor's&nbsp;Degree&nbsp;in&nbsp;Computer&nbsp;Science,&nbsp;Information&nbsp;Systems,&nbsp;Software&nbsp;Engineering,&nbsp;or&nbsp;other&nbsp;related&nbsp;disciplines.</li><li>Fresh&nbsp;graduates&nbsp;are&nbsp;welcome&nbsp;to&nbsp;apply;&nbsp;candidates&nbsp;with&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;<strong>2&nbsp;years&nbsp;of&nbsp;experience</strong>&nbsp;in&nbsp;Full&nbsp;Stack&nbsp;Development&nbsp;or&nbsp;Software&nbsp;Development&nbsp;are&nbsp;encouraged&nbsp;to&nbsp;apply.</li><li>Good&nbsp;understanding&nbsp;of&nbsp;frontend&nbsp;and&nbsp;backend&nbsp;development,&nbsp;RESTful&nbsp;APIs,&nbsp;databases,&nbsp;and&nbsp;software&nbsp;development&nbsp;lifecycle.</li><li>Experience&nbsp;with&nbsp;technologies&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;<strong>React.js,&nbsp;Next.js,&nbsp;Java,&nbsp;Spring&nbsp;Boot,&nbsp;Node.js,&nbsp;Go</strong>,&nbsp;or&nbsp;equivalent&nbsp;frameworks.</li><li>Familiarity&nbsp;with&nbsp;Git,&nbsp;cloud&nbsp;environments,&nbsp;deployment&nbsp;processes,&nbsp;or&nbsp;AI-assisted&nbsp;development&nbsp;tools&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;an&nbsp;advantage.</li><li>Strong&nbsp;analytical&nbsp;thinking,&nbsp;problem-solving&nbsp;skills,&nbsp;adaptability,&nbsp;and&nbsp;collaborative&nbsp;working&nbsp;style.</li></ul>",
